<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-ZUELLE WINS 15TH STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-ZUELLE WINS 15TH STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</headline>
<dateline>ALTO CRUZ DE LA DEMANDA, Spain 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex Zuelle of Switzerland won the 15th stage of the Tour of Spain over 210 kms from Cabarceno to Alto Cruz de la Demanda on Sunday.</p>
<p>He retained the overall leader's yellow jersey.</p>
</text>
